{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1444,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24a73b73e6fcf008fe95764c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚を上げるときもスムーズですし\r\n機能性が重視されていますね。\r\nこのデザイン…学びがあります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e2a3b25759d685bd3347c1a9986d5dca73c7349ac61b86afeb8910e2132214",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82538ac9ca45f05e4b5218d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高の『わたし』を表現する\r\nための大切なパートナーです。\r\n着こなしてみせます、必ず。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1dc2651a76d798405890457191df22ada44754088472535a9fd7a5461ed7d3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3af34fffa00878282d6cff9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "輝いて見えますか？\r\nふふ、レースでは今よりも\r\nもっと輝いてみせますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96987a6fd2a0615f115e6d82c502923d0da3c28c2a4e3270e881bf798eb38545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a4e1d31acfb33d83ba9414b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝、健康のために漢方茶を飲み\r\n始めたんですが、味に慣れなくて…\r\nうーん、アレンジしてみようかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "70547c4cea159dc3ddb53523acd167e01f6b9c639de98bf2b41dac21f735007a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeebcc0f492408eca2f2cb7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日発売のファッション雑誌が\r\nあるんです。お茶をしながら\r\nいっしょに読みませんか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e257ecc78a04b39516bbab2410eb17f740a102087842b2fe71084da3d9230721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fd119e02b9c4ae8dddc0e53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "輝く準備はできましたか？\r\nいざ、ランウェイへ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f28e272fd7b01cc535bb5895dfdc2c3dd23f08b45b4fc30692242da9bd39373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77e23aaf1010774ff0af2a1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぁ…んんっ、ダメダメ。\r\nアイロンをかけてから\r\n寝なくちゃ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a567893a66bb74f4fc3e791e7c3d766114228c1c98213623302a6c207abef444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07580732cafe8018d3fe4c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新入生の期待に満ちた瞳を見て\r\nいると、未知に希望を見出した\r\nあの日のことを思い出します。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79bf9514ef415fbbe59ee5a82844c34d213e3b7781e3befe394ab3b184f41472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2ffd20ed332e29120fd05e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水着のデザインも幅広いですよね。\r\nちなみにわたしの好みは…\r\nふふ、今度お見せしますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e317be8d60b450e7615f8fc97840939d6910fe4202b8ecb5c5982544e73780f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9e67d4bc88b647d022da128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄葉と紅葉…秋の美しさは、\r\nもの悲しくもありますが、\r\nそれもまた尊く感じます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a6f2d7985f80d716568518131bb990fa459255f09da9a3db0503c6b5f59cea0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:854eea15656516137f9d4338",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かわいくてオシャレな半纏を\r\nデザインしたいです！…あ、\r\n洋風アレンジとかもいいですねっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fe84588e2f13f33d46e6e0941da01205e7d402c830ce61fbc03ffa993ae99d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50207c1cee04851f96e8db7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迷いはありません。\r\n思いっきりお願いしますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "088be16be165ea5133903f875b53acd8fdee034948cbe6fec213b4357f32d98c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e96fc437802fa69b6c19c43f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0a6b383f2e589012ab15ee697c8524ebd6a4f89e3e9ebd6f5719aa716e64e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17b955f36e1ab3e28966e61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだ見ぬ光を求めて…なんて、\r\n言葉を飾りすぎましたか？\r\nでも、想いは嘘じゃありませんよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb65da27a736451a6d078677e3c0127ed2ba23170c5d64dbb2961fd8260fc73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db1d2cdc263c79e9ebb5923",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タオルを新調したんです。\r\nふわふわなんですよ。これで\r\nどんなに汗を流しても大丈夫です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54ac9d3cb4a2b39555a7ff9aa656db1beb7a9b0cde494aba0ef0dd92c04d261",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a28f12459e3bb6b2abed429",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたしが『わたし』の背中を\r\n押せるように…できることを\r\nせいいっぱいやってみます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9e4a0663eb0c3b37629602079e280f1dfeb57fbbeeede3920b8b655be5b6f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11ebf01aab42f624264c45c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1人よりも2人で…\r\nいっしょに考えてくれますか？\r\nわたしが輝くためのメニューを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "893c8a82d4654e49d4b7c8b308ffdddee6c5d5e6103ae583534a1bf91ad8309f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2176e41cb384d16aadeac1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんの教えで、\r\nわたしは自分の好きなところを\r\nたくさん見つけられた気がします。",
      "source_fingerprint": "545fe065b21683ec8b35cfc1674810af1c48263a69b6a31a6fc11eb2cbb9e5fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc27509cd1ae7d383a898f44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生まれ持った『わたし』と…\r\nトレーナーさん、いっしょに\r\n走り続けてくださいね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e58c98679723ab777b5d00f99653d5d6e7f2f9952af2d16629b5bb5dbc87e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60181a0c79cfe0dfb3501eee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "透き通るような青ですね！\r\n海からの風も爽快で…\r\nトレーニングも捗りそうです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc34fce6384ed922be910dc953a5bdba7f6feca24b263f609a97d28bc03d55a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a83ae3c3abb13130151b50a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これはわたしたちの輝きです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb083f3c2590bfd4bd057f3f72cc5a06472eaead45ce1c30d4240e6ce9cd44c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6dad70f8094d4f653384ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これからもときめきを胸に…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "788424adf58562c7eba1043272eb3566520ec4e602c312a565cf988675a58f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5009c5fa02f2c6f85b77455d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キレイに磨かれましたね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "947d7f9dd0ccd947d2e9d52bbf93de541ad614b875b7cef2b743a2438fb85f6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a942ea2102cf9a78f5d79f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可能性を広げましょう…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f672290173278c828c4ab5b952b402f00f1f96fed351d77a0e1b7e79108e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c08bd7eb6f7a654779d0dba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はい、わたしがノースフライトです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30b3524805daa1ea9726b8be5f064b147af340e412531ba1dc09351adc90e026",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddc3d097f4ecd75dd9d5da8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "輝いてみせます！\r\n自分を磨き、描いたスタイルで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed2f85922fe04cc590ae9e12b70e37d6b6dac0b21c39be357fa412684267f19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e53bf9246db64448d402e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フィッティングしますね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a22ba9ca5ab3092e7413bbe9508d3a7c2bf25afd5855f2086d690fba0e4dc20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec8893f469d4c337b1f581f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トータルコーディネートもお任せ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "879c6b3b54a0c182576e25b16782ac0811ef792d17204722947e45577cd8a2d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8f61bbfc75e2927b4a7616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76fedf1b165c197423903e335bad6eee1303026378c06ead8e3ea69b05677655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e21708be7ec3a7bb321b8520",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你──理解我。\r\n无论何时──都试着……理解。\r\n所以我──选择了你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45d56622b8d79540a57edd2c418b64390e74564141cfdb9b09bc71820b979927",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdc21d1b057414504da4d30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出発する。",
      "source_fingerprint": "338292f869214d620b3ed3650ba109c01617c1ef32b9d2df896687a9f0e4af3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea7251c1730de2753e13af08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰還した。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da930c4e9badf3b5a5b93a391e604bb408903ec65e05adf08fa30908e614bde7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3cb3bb01d676bbc8a7c9f76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么──你能够理解？\r\n我的心情……以及想法……\r\n没什么──这样帮了我很多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7989f9d0ec8492830cac348158ccb6131c51f409f5b3f396463305264077d9c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4387cd45d94d205ab23bf366",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有你在──\r\n「我」就会丰富起来……\r\n我有这种感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d6aa9a48fa0592bf523e77cda951ecf5d2a9f50b5696491f5b297364f68559",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c4d32f9fba761714108d15a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "──新年快乐。\r\n贺年卡和年菜都准备完毕了。\r\n……下一个mission是──开镜饼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9e828f2a78059910e450a1145bf353dadae32b246f2c331235ee1cfbcb7cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b2563d0a2a58e522bc9f094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「友情巧克力」──\r\n该当作异文化交流……尝试看看吗？\r\n……对方会在我送出前──逃跑吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "69361943649a3d994a7a74abd17a82249b1ff7385a7472223b5e9d32e1104ddc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e66fb29e95743bbe32ad70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备了礼物──要给你。\r\n这并不是……mission──\r\n是我的个人行为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b757e6a3a6c8408954de3d4d312e48a87528bffc00ca004ad31ae8ee3513b39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77c5f668e99976bd62e0f034",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "许愿签──我重写了好几次，\r\n汉字要写得匀称，不容易。\r\n尤其是──在锁定点的位置时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37c38f0ce4ed339da36e00eeb44a6801d1e098a36aa63ca42389128740df62de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25208a09f903cd449e76bfb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我仿效鲁道夫……准备了糖果。\r\n虽然不知道会不会有人\r\n对我恶作剧──但有备无患。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c83306acf67762e92326e2168e925a4e7628be8620b583fba640f50dce2f662",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ae72d40d7874257797c0cf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "报纸上把耶诞快乐写成……\r\n「耶丝诞快乐」。\r\n既然大家都开心──那也无妨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef3ca7dc29e80cdc9b1f65bf39a7e770aa548827deaab2092ef8dac34a6d9e1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f182fadd1e3354fad83cd856",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Holy night……要开……\r\n派对吗？在我祖国──\r\n会跟亲友一起庆祝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ac3a84f36ca875c20ad6ddd1b90d1b87b03b7fa7cd57d83be097d57e81bb06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0001beed7268e4a8faf0bb1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edf6e0a23ac408ba46580e4864a0d1593d368ce0b511159eaca76020ea74632d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:568b5e647b7a025b55eb79b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "──绝不──留情。\r\n收拾干净──连颗灰尘都不留……！\r\n喔……我是在说大扫除。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c720b62f1486a39b5c7fe4f9940ccfe1560df0dc4f9dfb8046b3d5646a9dca1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709c62b2ba0a929893fb1e55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在祖国……birthday──\r\n很多人会选择请假休息。\r\n你──还真是认真啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf10f92a2887b4e73fe8896472538a830f89b613ad7210cbd92053382c31262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13edf24a71bcb72ec4c4be7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "──生日──快乐。\r\n──我当然记得。\r\n重要的日子──我不会忘记。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e678d362eeecdf0a50d2b42859af09adbc7e4af4eb154d5c7070942dace0167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0baa2f28b4be073a5a0e37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算碰到生日──\r\n训练──也不休息。\r\n──这就是──我应有的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59518385448a3dc34a7b8319a74bd520711de4d564326b212e5d92b2411a8642",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3714af8ea09f72c485ee2e24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日──你愿意帮我庆祝吗？\r\n……不──没问题。\r\nThank you so much.",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc1e0be9a66757a58e8f8b3df81aae560da8e9052810c9c671f8307fcbe328f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:179afea02f944543ca5d6d67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "──好像有公告。\r\n建议你查看一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bcab815e0a196ee91f7b2933f699def859a3b801866cdd899e5520f635219dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acda9717c44ee6afaa72aad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "──A present.\r\n指名要送你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42a971c414849004c325f97a80468b8ce157257187c7de5e7521afc91a89793c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e78899764877430dffadd85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mission Accomplished.\r\n──真是出色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31a8779d0578011c252689efdee100d8ef71a852a87bd8db21b72aaefb11faf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8394e5183b1ba617df3f706c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "──最近好像有活动。\r\n──我会做好──事前调查。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f27fa00e2f2994bde3a06bc6f9ad80459aeb78da2193fbaeb2d4cf84d843a651",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22ffca4651b776928185eaa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动──正在举办中。\r\n如果有需要……我也参加吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e2542144b8e64e8e72a5e645efb33346c507a9a850c32049f9657e37696b596",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7b8e6641a4e5ab94c66cf38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc7a3196bdd725292db568ae04e5f1966973e71b24298f1c97842e56b5561108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c831269ad2c2044df2e52677",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级……\r\n好像提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5d9abf6eaf0bfe2e1453f5b27b00da2490d5e6dc78d5738452c011bc4aba428",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b3c72a780531504039dab3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このブルゾンは――汚れにくく、\r\n乾きやすい。手入れのしやすさは\r\n重要だ。――任務のためにも…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5103cc1b2e261d348bdfe7f878acbb883f94949ddab1c2a293e8b0ae6e74668",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2495e9b4f7ec8770f15f889a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腹が冷えないかとよく心配されるが\r\nNo problem.　――昔から\r\n代謝がいいせいか――冷えない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4dcbbc78accd4ec35787a7beaa65e4e01131db09922254237e44ad051170283",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112018b9dc5724a0b11ea76e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わき腹が痒く――掻いたら…\r\n破れたことがある。以来――\r\n力加減には、注意している。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e077fb6e4f0d0a28d5c0ae09f3e314e8138949bfc1c3ede08a6dc50e40afcd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0040bb084039f47edd96047c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不相上下吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb33b79db17b942d7fc5b826e93446d05bf84173c49ba53ded65b86cf078c26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c9b4fd711efac3e3d814124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mission Accomplished.",
      "source_fingerprint": "81a065cf1faa822a10baf0ef7512be03a25676245aa70f900daa4655a2fc0874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c07959c2bc382e15d5a90f95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真遗憾……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea388628d91740324add460da4117a9c14e91958f600421d58676a45c67854c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbc933a8aebafc4c92f3e977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不相上下吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb33b79db17b942d7fc5b826e93446d05bf84173c49ba53ded65b86cf078c26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae09024c2bfa494a74f8d88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新高分纪录了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9480ef615abc3e4be1eb2f46298e78089d8a660f72b14c1a0825b01b2a868fec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d926dbfc1e69289bfe1646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Leave it to me.",
      "source_fingerprint": "2787e327622e4cf1fdb8f8cf325ca0eec942580feba87fae2fa0539682b1c2c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1851ce5357777b5c59780fd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f1a35541bdd3dbabede66ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚踏实地的训练……\r\n最为重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ff80241f512be3c71c8304262fb2572be0dc4c09b2388ed7e977f08b799fd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5853dc5bf4a818ef99377fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "了解学园的历史──\r\n也是学生的义务。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8ee1e494f11f7158a6c008d7aaffc8be64c8ec69e57aea318daf518783eea2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a743b082781b1828b61ee3ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参赛吗──？了解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca13386bb4458b475c3a74e833f4ee7eccbf3a5c24fd3e91b9e4d862a74dcca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b443148a6c85b10c7ee85f56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报恩……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ed2019cb7b9a6c980435bbc90767b8046422b1e315080c683b6c363277bdd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a622b100c882d63d79b9112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's go.",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35083c931ac17bcaf2bbc3a9bb6107b3214142cae3f9e25914ceabfbf2ef912",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dce9453cfe4f5e1d6e1ec08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "061dc3a2e5c7e436c621c77aa82c3cb6759345d51a920b40239a336272405fc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d360543b5b53d9ddeef8f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "All right.",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cdbc2f5a8795c92e6c74cd59104e753aacc7fa54ddd6b1e62d2fe630929e6ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "1184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6481d77e71e55cdad8d5a96d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26085c6d318e98a1a7f37756",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oh……这股力量是──！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e37ad7a538abe4c7fb7074f65591c0dfeca768cab94d5cd7d346010aa9e49b9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f460248dbb1ef880d7fa602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的──登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e439933bcf24431e89f73f4a3e176b6c1e441fa573194a533227037040dc19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ab13d0f4231991b4858bdbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Ready to go.",
      "source_fingerprint": "19d2bf6c1545f2ff53a2d5bda2e55100ee36c1eabe9da664682624cac3cf49b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9250646ff2046e49f9eb2acb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Get.",
      "source_fingerprint": "56171c4924b48936cd37e4285581d2c786866d81d9512b043d78cb1a42f2038e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d12fa5d51cf0456d2785fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5850cca68c1bf12a91f4336f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Great.\r\n太佩服了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c3bde4f760372c9d2bc03d1ab156972cab8873f2e5332af0a0253dfbf72aaee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc2220c0438287cc64f77507",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK.\r\n成功get了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2f5576053b450106745d050623d236728b6d1c1e2834674f61a0d97229266d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc967f53d888c07089fc3e6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别沮丧了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9750f4a0240f77299ebbaf0262e328e1abc9bdbf8685575ae85d1f12726a1ad6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
